          "urpx:description": "Customer is on the PRIME base RatePlan (qualifying technology: storage / EV / heat-pump / NBT) AND has elected the CPP variant. CPP election is a Bundled-Service-Customer-only option per Sheet 16 SC 4.d; DA / CCA customers are ineligible. CPP-elected customers are also ineligible for most other DR programs.",
          "urpx:hasConditionExpression": {
